# Full reference — what every variable does, where each credential comes from, and how
# to verify it:  docs/ENV_SETUP_GUIDE.md
# Origin of the TRACE backend API, e.g. https://api.trace.example.com
#
# Leave BLANK for local development: requests stay relative (/api, /socket.io)
# and the Vite dev proxy in vite.config.js forwards them to localhost:3300.
#
# Set it when the built SPA is served from a different host than the API
# (the Vercel + separate-backend deployment). Vite inlines VITE_* variables at
# BUILD time, so on Vercel this is a *build* environment variable and changing
# it requires a redeploy, not a restart.
#
# No trailing slash.
VITE_API_URL=
